</volume><fpage>141</fpage><lpage>3</lpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="ref10"><label>10</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Durbin</surname><given-names>KL</given-names></name><name><surname>Diaz-Montes</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Loveless</surname><given-names>MB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Van wyk and grumbach syndrome: An unusual case and review of the literature</article-title><source>J Pediatr Adolesc Gynecol</source><year>2011</year><volume>24</volume><fpage>93</fpage><lpage>6</lpage><comment>Ipis aborion estiunt eosam</comment></element-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>